          "type": null,
          "body": "\"The UTF-8 mode was added in Python 3.7. To keep compatibility with Python 3.6, enable it via the `PYTHONUTF8` environment variable (rather than the `-X utf8` option), since the variable will just be ignored by versions of Python that don't support it.\"",
